~ post_confrontation_discussion
# julian walks off for good; from here it's fiona and layla alone (huddle layout).
do actor_effect("Julian", "turn_away")
Julian turns back to his work without another word.
do party_dismiss()
if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true:
	if Flags.get_level_flag("julian_nearly_told_truth") == true:
		# TEMPLATE — Fiona nearly told Julian about the sequencing.
		Layla: Fiona! You almost told him!
		Player: I know. It slipped out. My bad.
		do actor_effect("Layla", "tremble")
		Layla: He's the last person who should know I haven't finished the sequencing...
		Layla: Or maybe, second last. I don't know...
		Player: Relax. He didn't get anything out of us.
	else
		# TEMPLATE — Fiona shut Julian down.
		Layla: Well... that went great.
		Player: He was never going to help. Not for free.
	# TEMPLATE — both routes: the next lead.
	Layla: So what now? My phone's dead, and yours...
	Player: Can't get on the internet. Yes.
	Player: Hmmm. I'm not sure.
	Player: All I know is that we need to find out that date one way or another.
	Player: The date DNA was discovered.
	if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") < 0:
		Layla: ...Okay.
	else
		do actor_effect("Layla", "jump")
		Layla: Got it. Let's do what we can!
	Player: Yep.
else
	# step 2.227: no solo playthrough (Layla is always with Fiona). fallback only, so the branch stays valid.
	Player: This is a template line.
do Flags.set_level_flag("dna_dates_lookup_pending", true)
=> END

